---
title: Select
description: A control for choosing one or more values from a list.

links:
  doc: https://shardsui.com/svelte/select
---

<ComponentPreview name="p-select-1" />

## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/select.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as Select from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/select";
</script>

<Select.Root {items}>
  <Select.Trigger><Select.Value placeholder="Select a framework" /></Select.Trigger>
  <Select.Popup>
    {#each items as item (item.value)}
      <Select.Item value={item.value}>{item.label}</Select.Item>
    {/each}
  </Select.Popup>
</Select.Root>
```

## API Reference

### Select.Root

Manages single or multiple selection and popup state.

### Select.Trigger

Opens the select popup.

### Select.Value

Displays the selected value or a custom typed snippet.

### Select.Popup

Contains the selectable options.

### Select.Item

An individual option with its selection indicator.

### Select.Group

Groups related options.

### Select.Label

Labels the entire select.

### Select.GroupLabel

Labels a group of options.

### Select.Separator

Separates groups or options.

### Select.Button

A standalone button with select-trigger styling.

